# Dynamic horizontal game-row padding for non-stock row counts. Stock six-row
# geometry remains byte-for-byte unchanged. Outer padding stays at 20 pixels
# through row 9, then follows max(15, 29 - rows). The visible post-icon gap
# stays at 15 pixels through row 7, then follows max(5, 22 - rows). The shared
# row renderer is used by ROM, Favourite, Recent and contextual Search-result
# lists, while the established active/previous game-list pointer guards leave
# unrelated TextMenu users stock.
