# that renders candidate UTF-8 substrings with the actual detail-title font and
# uses the resulting SDL_Surface width. It prefers word boundaries and falls
# back to UTF-8 code-point boundaries for an individual word wider than the
# available line. The draw rectangle is 350 pixels; the helper uses 340 pixels
# to retain a small right-side margin.
